[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0010","text":"彩排感觉怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0020","text":"看起来不太好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0030","text":"看一眼不就知道了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0040","text":"是吗……换了服装确实会不太一样……\n更何况，羽那和阳希…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0050","text":"…………\n上了舞台，就会出现练习时没暴露的问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0060","text":"能修正吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0070","text":"我怎么知道…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0080","text":"…………\n有什么我能帮忙的就跟我说"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0090","text":"…………\n…………只能想办法解决了呗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0100","text":"嗯…………\n是啊…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
